Intelligence has confirmed that the units you met while on patrol are Chinese, but we still know very little about why they are here, or even how long they have been here. They have some form of technology allowing their tanks to become invisible to radar and sight, which we guess to be derived from an alien relic. You will have to be very careful not to be caught unawares by this. We need to know more about the Chinese - you are to head a recon mission to locate the Chinese HQ and find out as much as possible about the cloaking device.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
 - Establish a base.
 - Locate Chinese HQ.
 - Observe Chinese units using the cloaking device.

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
Our observations of the Chinese craft suggest that they are unable to use their weapons while cloaked, but this is not the advantage it may at first seem, since they are totally undetectable while cloaked. Bear in mind that the first warning you get of Chinese presence near you will be when they open fire.